SaffronCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_MaraNoDoll::
	.string "You're RED, aren't you?\p"
	.string "THOMAS said someone might come to\n"
	.string "see me.\p"
	.string "If he sent something, bring it when\n"
	.string "you're ready.$"

SaffronCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_MaraDoll::
	.string "You're RED, aren't you?\p"
	.string "...He sent this?\p"
	.string "This was mine when I was little. He\n"
	.string "kept it after I got sick.\p"
	.string "He always said he'd give it back\n"
	.string "when I was better.\p"
	.string "...Guess I am.\p"
	.string "I'm not ready to forgive him.\p"
	.string "But if he's really turning himself\n"
	.string "in... maybe that's the first honest\n"
	.string "thing he's done in a long time.\p"
	.string "Thank you for bringing this.\p"
	.string "I want you to take TAUROS. I'm not\n"
	.string "much of a TRAINER, and he deserves\n"
	.string "to travel with someone who actually\n"
	.string "goes places.$"

SaffronCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_MaraTaurosNoRoom::
	.string "TAUROS can't go with you yet.\p"
	.string "Come back after making room for him.\n"
	.string "Keep the DOLL until then.$"

SaffronCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_MaraTaurosReceived::
	.string "RED received TAUROS from MARA!$"

SaffronCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_MaraFinal::
	.string "Take care of him, okay?\p"
	.string "And... if you ever see THOMAS again,\n"
	.string "don't speak for me.\p"
	.string "I'll decide what I want to say when\n"
	.string "I'm ready.$"

SaffronCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_MaraComplete::
	.string "TAUROS deserves to see the world.\p"
	.string "And whatever happens with THOMAS,\n"
	.string "I'll decide that for myself.$"
